node_modules/
.env
*.log

# NOTE: data/state.json is intentionally NOT ignored.
# If you deploy via the GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/post.yml),
# the bot commits its own state file back to the repo after each run so it
# remembers what it already posted — ignoring it would make the bot repeat
# itself every run since Actions runners are wiped between jobs. If you
# instead run the bot on a long-lived server (VPS, Railway, etc.) via
# `npm run schedule`, state.json just lives on disk there and never needs
# to be committed — feel free to re-add it to this file in that case.
